  "scope": "Actual stdGaussian E on any finite-dimensional real Hilbert space, including rank0, for signed real C2compact f. Internally produced square/Phi-square/gradient-square L1 and homogeneous entropy<=2 actual gradient-square integral. Actual canonical orthonormal law map and gradient Parseval are internal; no supplied law/LSI/domain/energy/limit/basis certificates. Compact sufficient background only; actual32 noncompact cutoff/coherent33 KL/Fisher, T2/FIRST4.6, both paper algorithms/main/error/work/cost/composition and full reader/PURIFIED remain open.",
